k22jcbmaam6_t_avellaneda_stoikov_reservation_price", "label": "Avellaneda\u2013Stoikov reservation-price interpretation", "file_type": "concept", "source_file": "nomisma/reference/HSK22JcbMAAm6_T.jpeg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "The displayed algebra matches the reservation-price formula conventionally interpreting s as mid-price, q as inventory, \u03b3 as risk aversion, \u03c3 as volatility, and T \u2212 t as remaining time. The image supplies no symbol definitions or model attribution, so these meanings are inferred."}, {"id": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_conditional_inventory_shift", "label": "Conditional linear shift from the baseline", "file_type": "rationale", "source_file": "nomisma/reference/HSK22JcbMAAm6_T.jpeg", "source_location": null, "source_url": null, "captured_at": null, "author": null, "contributor": null, "rationale": "Holding the other parameters fixed, r changes linearly with q. If \u03b3\u03c3\u00b2(T \u2212 t) is positive, positive q places r below s and negative q places r above s. The formula alone does not establish parameter signs or units."}], "edges": [{"source": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_equation", "target": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_baseline_s", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "nomisma/reference/HSK22JcbMAAm6_T.jpeg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_equation", "target": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_adjustment_term", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "nomisma/reference/HSK22JcbMAAm6_T.jpeg", "source_location": null, "weight": 1}, {"source": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_adjustment_term", "target": "nomisma_reference_hsk22jcbmaam6_t_q", "relation": "references", "confidence": "EXTRACTED", "confidence_score": 1, "source_file": "nomisma/reference/HSK2